    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "You can set this property to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) for a video connection if [`isCameraIntrinsicMatrixDeliverySupported`](avcaptureconnection/iscameraintrinsicmatrixdeliverysupported.md) is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), and only before calling the [`AVCaptureSession`](avcapturesession.md) [`startRunning()`](avcapturesession/startrunning().md) method.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 [`isCameraIntrinsicMatrixDeliverySupported`](avcaptureconnection/iscameraintrinsicmatrixdeliverysupported.md)가 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)일 때 비디오 연결에 대해 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 설정할 수 있으며, [`AVCaptureSession`](avcapturesession.md) [`startRunning()`](avcapturesession/startrunning().md) 메서드를 호출하기 전에서만 가능합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b417a1db8ea58b4fb28c8ae4c98821c3e43d69e805250cd944c5fe370bca3a3f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "The default value is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false).",
      "ko": "기본값은 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d4420af4c56a26d1c0593948897f598ceded48c9146427e6c08c3ddafbd53d0d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Camera intrinsics describe the current imaging parameters of a capture device in ways that you can use to render overlays or perform computer vision tasks.",
      "ko": "카메라 내부 행렬은 캡처 장치의 현재 촬영 파라미터를 설명하며, 이를 사용해 오버레이를 렌더링하거나 컴퓨터 비전 작업을 수행할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "25c5140b01fc24001c187ce41a3aceb637791700b2cfd9c5de5a4f8d88bdde10",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "If [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), any [`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`](avcapturevideodataoutput.md) instance in this connection can include the [`kCMSampleBufferAttachmentKey_CameraIntrinsicMatrix`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/kCMSampleBufferAttachmentKey_CameraIntrinsicMatrix) attachment for each sample buffer it vends.",
      "ko": "If [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), any [`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`](avcapturevideodataoutput.md) instance in this connection can include the [`kCMSampleBufferAttachmentKey_CameraIntrinsicMatrix`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/kCMSampleBufferAttachmentKey_CameraIntrinsicMatrix) attachment for each sample buffer it vends.",
      "sourceHash": "4d58ecab6f35f29b851fbf021c9cc1e095165dbbf1519d8da293b78545bdf576",
      "status": "failed"
    },
